    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 25 Kinsella Hall to the Castleknock market. This is a vacant two-bedroom, first floor apartment ideally positioned within the highly regarded Collegewood development in Castleknock. The development is renowned for its attractive landscaped communal gardens and family friendly atmosphere, complete with a children's playground and a montessori. Everything Castleknock Village has to offer is within easy walking distance, accessed in c. 10 minutes via a convenient pedestrian walkway at the rear of the development. Castleknock offers a wide range of cafés, restaurants, boutique shops, schools, and leisure facilities. The magnificent Phoenix Park, one of Europe's largest enclosed city parks, is also close by, offering extensive walking and cycling trails, sports facilities, and open green spaces. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with bus routes just a short walk away and Castleknock Train Station nearby, providing regular services to Dublin City Centre. For motorists, the M50 is easily accessible, ensuring straightforward connections to Dublin Airport, the city centre, and the wider motorway network.\n\nThis fantastic apartment offers bright, open, and spacious living accommodation extending to approximately 85 sq m. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with hot press & storage closet and further benefits of a modern kitchen with an open plan living/dining area with feature bar. There are two double bedrooms both with build in wardrobes and one ensuite bathroom as well as the main family bathroom. Externally, the property boasts a private balcony with SOUTH-WEST facing that overlooks the green communal gardens.\n\nPresented in vacant possession and ready for immediate occupancy, No. 25 is sure to appeal to both first-time buyers and investors alike. The property further benefits from a B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage, lift and stairs access, gas fired central heating, built in wardrobes, a private balcony with SOUTH- WEST facing orientation and a chain free sale for a quick turnaround.\n\nFeatures; \n c.85 sq m\n 2 BED/ 2 BATH\n BER B qualifying of a green mortgage\n Gas fired central heating\n Lift and stairs access\n Designated parking with EV chargers available\n Built in 2004\n Balcony with SOUTH- WEST facing orientation\n Management fee c.2,900 p/a\n Spacious double bedrooms\n Built in wardrobes\n Situated in a prime location in Castleknock\n Ready for immediate occupancy\n Castleknock Train Station and Castleknock Village within minutes\n Public transport links & schools in close proximity\n Mature, sought after development\n Viewing is highly advised!\n\nDirections:\n\nWhen driving into the Collegewood development, drive past the montessori and keep going straight. Kinsella Hall is the first building on the right. You will see the main door with ' Kinsella Hall 20-38'. You can then go to the 1st floor via stairs or lift and no. 25 will be on the left hand side."
      },
